WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.589 --> 00:00:11.174
Marigold Tips, a synthetic project. Every save point was checked with its own tests.

2
00:00:11.174 --> 00:00:20.233
A Claude Code turn starts. Time Machine saves the project first.

3
00:00:20.233 --> 00:00:24.848
The turn ends. Its save point is checked in a safe copy.

4
00:00:24.848 --> 00:00:35.661
Broken. The app says since when, and names the last version that works.

5
00:00:35.661 --> 00:00:44.862
Go back. First, review what comes back and what does not.

6
00:00:44.862 --> 00:00:51.306
Secret values and anything outside the project do not come back. It says so first.

7
00:00:51.306 --> 00:00:58.424
Bring it back. It lands as a separate copy on a new branch.

8
00:00:58.424 --> 00:01:07.658
The working version is back. Your folder was not touched.
